  "strengths": [
    "Cell-level visibility labels for fine-grained, multi-level security",
    "Server-side iterators push filtering and aggregation into scans and compactions",
    "Scales to very large sorted tables on commodity HDFS clusters",
    "Long-term-maintenance (LTM) release line with regular patch releases"
  ],
  "weaknesses": [
